{"id":"16caabeaf9659398","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-wellorder.md","title":"Well-Ordering","display":"df-wellorder — Well-Ordering","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-wellorder","aliases":["68-df-wellorder"],"display":"df-wellorder — Well-Ordering","depends_on":[],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF","verification_status":"pending-source","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-wellorder"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-wellorder</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-wellorder — Well-Ordering"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Supplementary entry; not located in the supplied Shoenfield PDF"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(R\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span>。以下 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WellOrder}(R,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{WellOrder}(R,X)\\)</span> 指严格良序，未假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 可递归。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WellOrder}(R,X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;(\\forall x\\in X\\;((x,x)\\notin R))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(((x,y)\\in R\\land(y,z)\\in R)\\Longrightarrow(x,z)\\in R))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\ne y\\Longrightarrow((x,y)\\in R\\lor(y,x)\\in R)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall S\\subseteq X\\;(S\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\exists m\\in S\\;\\forall x\\in S\\;((x,m)\\notin R))).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WellOrder}(R,X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\;&amp;(\\forall x\\in X\\;((x,x)\\notin R))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(((x,y)\\in R\\land(y,z)\\in R)\\Longrightarrow(x,z)\\in R))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\ne y\\Longrightarrow((x,y)\\in R\\lor(y,x)\\in R)))\\\\\n&amp;\\land(\\forall S\\subseteq X\\;(S\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\exists m\\in S\\;\\forall x\\in S\\;((x,m)\\notin R))).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留自包含的严格良序定义，删除错误的跨书 relation 链接以及未使用的 recursive-set 依赖。旧 Remark 所说“递归集合上的扩展”并非 Assertion 的前提，已澄清。给定短书没有定位到此条来源。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WellOrder}(R,X)","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{WellOrder}(R,X)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\;&(\\forall x\\in X\\;((x,x)\\notin R))\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;(((x,y)\\in R\\land(y,z)\\in R)\\Longrightarrow(x,z)\\in R))\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall x,y\\in X\\;(x\\ne y\\Longrightarrow((x,y)\\in R\\lor(y,x)\\in R)))\\\\\n&\\land(\\forall S\\subseteq X\\;(S\\ne\\varnothing\\Longrightarrow\\exists m\\in S\\;\\forall x\\in S\\;((x,m)\\notin R))).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1330,"backlinks":[{"id":"f850298d5e806601","anchor":"ref-56","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-wellorder]]"},{"id":"be41c4d7dd143cb1","anchor":"ref-98","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-wellorder]] — definition"},{"id":"3cb8c24064050ea6","anchor":"ref-145","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[68-df-wellorder|df-wellorder — Well-Ordering]]"}],"outgoing":[]}